py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors ease-out focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><span class="font-mono text-xs tabular-nums">4</span>Keep the files</button></div><div role="tabpanel" id="sovereign-walk-panel" aria-labelledby="sovereign-walk-code" class="flex w-full max-w-3xl flex-col gap-6"><div class="flex min-h-80 flex-col animate-in fade-in duration-slower ease-out"><div class="bg-background flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg border"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b px-4 py-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="bg-muted-foreground/40 size-2.5 rounded-full"></span><span class="bg-muted-foreground/40 size-2.5 rounded-full"></span><span class="bg-muted-foreground/40 size-2.5 rounded-full"></span></span><span class="text-muted-foreground min-w-0 truncate font-mono text-xs">github.com/kortix-ai/CompanyOS</span></div><ul class="flex flex-col divide-y"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1 px-4 py-3 sm:px-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">apps/web</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">the web app</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1 px-4 py-3 sm:px-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">apps/api</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">the API</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1 px-4 py-3 sm:px-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">apps/llm-gateway</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">the LLM gateway</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1 px-4 py-3 sm:px-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">apps/cli</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">the kortix CLI</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1 px-4 py-3 sm:px-6"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">packages/sdk</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">@kortix/sdk</span></li></ul></div></div><p class="text-foreground px-4 text-center text-base text-balance animate-in fade-in duration-slower ease-out">The web app, the API, the LLM gateway, the CLI and the SDK live in one public repository.</p></div></div><p class="text-foreground px-4 text-center text-base font-medium text-balance">Kortix Cloud or your own server. <span class="text-muted-foreground">The same images either way.</span></p></div></div></section>"`;
